OL,3,GNEWSADiscovery of skulls reveals
OL,4,A6,000-year-old mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 140 years ago, dock workers
OL,7,Fmade a discovery that would take
OL,8,Fgenerations to explain - 23 human
OL,9,Fskulls buried alongside the remains of
OL,10,Fprehistoric animals.
OL,12,FThe extraordinary haul included more
OL,13,Fthan 60 pairs of red deer antlers,
OL,14,Faurochs skulls and two dugout canoes,
OL,15,Frevealing that the area had been a site
OL,16,Fof human activity for thousands of
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,19,FWhen the Albert Edward Dock opened in
OL,20,FPreston in 1892, it was the largest
OL,21,Fsingle dock in England.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
